cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Stratigraphic Amenity, please cite this software and the PEACE paper that motivated its workflow."
title: "Stratigraphic Amenity"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: "Eigenform"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EigenformAI/stratigraphic-amenity"
url: "https://github.com/EigenformAI/stratigraphic-amenity"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A composable Python SDK and local Model Context Protocol server for
  geologic-map processing, affine georeferencing, geological knowledge
  retrieval, and evidence rendering. Stratigraphic Amenity adapts ideas and
  selected MIT-licensed code from Microsoft PEACE while leaving OCR, VLM
  interpretation, and final answer generation to the client.
keywords:
  - geologic maps
  - georeferencing
  - geology
  - model context protocol
  - MCP
references:
  - type: article
    title: "PEACE: Empowering Geologic Map Holistic Understanding with MLLMs"
